From c540fc9528b95e280c99eac2ac05950e58286dc0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chang An <chang.an_1@nxp.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 16:01:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] tests: bluetooth: classic: add OPP board-to-board test
 suite

Add a Twister multi-DUT test for the Bluetooth Classic Object Push
Profile (OPP). Both boards run the same image; the pytest harness makes
DUT0 the Push Client ('opp_c') and DUT1 the Push Server ('opp_s') and
drives a real OPP session over RFCOMM/OBEX.

The suite covers transport connect/disconnect, OBEX connect/disconnect,
Object Push, Business Card Pull and Exchange, and abort. A build-only
'no_blobs' scenario builds the image for mimxrt1170_evk@B/mimxrt1176/cm7
with CONFIG_BUILD_ONLY_NO_BLOBS=y, so CI can compile it without the
binary firmware blobs.

Tested on two mimxrt1170_evk@B/mimxrt1176/cm7 boards.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5
Signed-off-by: Chang An <chang.an_1@nxp.com>
